 "title": "drawText 用默认 Paint 时，每次 fillText 前按首个强方向字符设 ctx.direction",
 "product": "代码",
 "triggers": [
  {
   "read": "`canvas.drawText(...)` 配默认 `new Paint()`，只改了 `setTextAlign`，没设 bidi 或方向",
